    {
      "start": 330.12,
      "end": 333.68,
      "text": "here, right?"
    },
    {
      "start": 331.56,
      "end": 334.8,
      "text": "So, if you were to feed in red, this"
    },
    {
      "start": 333.68,
      "end": 336.12,
      "text": "system would produce the text my"
    },
    {
      "start": 334.8,
      "end": 338.16,
      "text": "favorite color is red. If you were to"
    },
    {
      "start": 336.12,
      "end": 339.92,
      "text": "feed in the color white, it would spit"
    },
    {
      "start": 338.16,
      "end": 341.68,
      "text": "out the text my favorite color is white."
    },
    {
      "start": 339.92,
      "end": 342.84000000000003,
      "text": "If you were to feed in the color blue,"
    },
    {
      "start": 341.68,
      "end": 344.28000000000003,
