    },
    {
      "start": 342.84,
      "end": 345.35999999999996,
      "text": "color is blue. Hopefully that makes"
    },
    {
      "start": 344.28,
      "end": 347.64,
      "text": "sense."
    },
    {
      "start": 345.36,
      "end": 350.08000000000004,
      "text": "Now is where we get to evaluators,"
    },
    {
      "start": 347.64,
      "end": 352.96,
      "text": "right? So,"
    },
    {
      "start": 350.08,
      "end": 355.32,
      "text": "data is what we use to"
    },
    {
      "start": 352.96,
      "end": 356.88,
      "text": "test the target system, right? So, for"
    },
    {
      "start": 355.32,
      "end": 359.88,
      "text": "example,"
    },
    {
      "start": 356.88,
      "end": 361.76,
      "text": "the data that we're testing with is"
    },
    {
      "start": 359.88,
      "end": 364.52,
      "text": "here, right?"
    },
    {
      "start": 361.76,
      "end": 367.24,
      "text": "So, it's a collection of two"
    },
    {
      "start": 364.52,
      "end": 369.59999999999997,
      "text": "input output pairs, right? You can see"
    },
    {
      "start": 367.24,
      "end": 373.44,
      "text": "we're testing feeding in the color blue"
    },
    {
      "start": 369.6,
      "end": 375.36,
      "text": "and then green into this target system."
    },
    {
      "start": 373.44,
      "end": 377.52,
      "text": "And"
    },
    {
      "start": 375.36,
      "end": 380.44,
      "text": "we have one evaluator called the keyword"
    },
    {
      "start": 377.52,
      "end": 383.24,
      "text": "inclusion evaluator,"
    },
    {
      "start": 380.44,
      "end": 386.36,
      "text": "and all this does is takes a look at"
    },
    {
      "start": 383.24,
      "end": 389.76,
      "text": "what the output is"
    },
    {
      "start": 386.36,
      "end": 392.44,
      "text": "that is generated by the target system,"
    },
    {
      "start": 389.76,
      "end": 395.4,
      "text": "and confirms that the output generated"
    },
    {
      "start": 392.44,
      "end": 398.64,
      "text": "by the target system contains"
    },
    {
      "start": 395.4,
      "end": 401.28,
      "text": "the text provided on the output side of"
    },
    {
      "start": 398.64,
      "end": 402.76,
      "text": "each example in our data set, right? So,"
    },
    {
      "start": 401.28,
      "end": 404.28,
      "text": "if we feed in blue,"
    },
    {
      "start": 402.76,
      "end": 406.76,
      "text": "the target system will spit out the text"
    },
    {
      "start": 404.28,
      "end": 408.84,
      "text": "my favorite color is blue, and we're"
    },
    {
      "start": 406.76,
      "end": 411.24,
      "text": "just checking that the output generated"
    },
    {
      "start": 408.84,
      "end": 413.67999999999995,
